      "characterName": "Eustace Peel",
      "characterId": "eustace-peel",
      "fullSpecies": "Erethizon dorsatum",
      "platform": "facebook",
      "format": "regular",
      "title": "Something happened to the wood",
      "prose": "The wall tasted so good that I went outside to see whether something had happened to the trees.\n\nBit a branch. Chewed well into it. Ordinary wood.\n\nBack inside, I put my teeth under the pale edge and pulled. A thin sheet came away. Another layer underneath, with that same extraordinary taste.\n\nI sat down in the shavings and started on the next layer.",
